  "Same rig, bones, animations and hitbox as Meteor Maw; only textures and added boxes change.",
  "A frozen comet: pale blue ice rock with glowing cyan cracks, a cold-light maw, clear ice teeth, and icicles hanging from the brow and arms.",
  "Its Effect Pulse applies Slowness instead of heat damage (a config swap on the same ability). Adds are Splinter Mites with a frost tint.",
  "Spawns when a Meteor Fall event rolls a comet (rarer at night)."
